{"actions":[{"id":"163;a","state":"SUCCESS","returnValue":{"articleType":"Public","id":"kaAUG00000012uD2AQ","item":{"Public_Article__c":"<div class=\"article\">\n<div class=\"article-head\">\n<div class=\"tip\">\n<h2>What We&#39;ll Cover<\/h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#embedded-providers\">Embedded Payment Providers<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"#open-providers\">Open Payment Providers<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"#apm\">Alternative payment methods and digital wallets<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"#accelerated-checkout\">Accelerated Checkout solutions<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"#faq\">FAQ<\/a><\/li><\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"article-body\">\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"intro\">\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<p>BigCommerce supports a broad range of payment gateway integrations, serving numerous countries and currencies.<\/p>\n<p>Select gateways support Alternative Payment Methods (APMs) like Alipay, Klarna, and SEPA along with leading digital wallets such as Amazon Pay, Apple Pay, and Google Pay. These options allow you to offer increased payment flexibility and popular regional methods.<\/p>\n<p>Accelerated Checkout solutions, Fastlane by PayPal and Stripe Link, provide shoppers with low-friction, passwordless checkout experiences that reduce cart abandonment and improve conversion.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"anchor-margin\" id=\"embedded-providers\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"embedded-providers\"><a class=\"Permalink-link\" href=\"#embedded-providers\"> <\/a>\n<h3>Embedded Payment Providers<\/h3>\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<p>Processing payments through BigCommerce gateway integrations on the <a href=\"https://www.bigcommerce.com/payments/embedded-payment-providers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Embedded Payment Provider list<\/a> <strong>do not<\/strong> incur <a href=\"/s/article/Pricing\" target=\"_parent\" data-lightning-target=\"_subtab\">Open Payment Provider fees<\/a>. Note that custom integrations to processors on the Embedded Payment Provider list, including those connected via third-party apps, will incur Open Payment Provider fees.<\/p>\n<p>See each gateway\u2019s documentation for details such as requirements, limitations, setup instructions, supported countries and currencies, and additional features.<\/p>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div class=\"panel-heading media\">\n<div class=\"media-left pull-left\"><span class=\"sl sl-lightbulb-2 alert-icon\"> <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"media-body\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>Using a \u201cPowered By\u201d store?<\/strong> If you were onboarded to BigCommerce through a partner, you may not have access to all listed payment gateways.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<ul><li><strong>Manual Capture<\/strong> \u2014 Authorized payments can be <a href=\"/s/article/Manually-Capturing-Transactions-Authorize-Only\" target=\"_parent\" data-lightning-target=\"_subtab\">captured manually<\/a> at a later date.<\/li><li><strong>3D Secure<\/strong> \u2014 An <a href=\"/s/article/3D-Secure\" target=\"_parent\" data-lightning-target=\"_subtab\">additional security layer<\/a> that helps prevent unauthorized transactions.<\/li><li><strong>Multicurrency<\/strong> \u2014 Supports <a href=\"/s/article/Using-Multiple-Currencies\" target=\"_parent\" data-lightning-target=\"_subtab\">multiple transactional currencies<\/a>.<\/li><li><strong>Stored Payment Methods<\/strong> \u2014 Payment details <a href=\"/s/article/Enabling-Stored-Payment-Methods\" target=\"_parent\" data-lightning-target=\"_subtab\">can be stored<\/a> for future transactions.<\/li><li><strong>Recurring Payments<\/strong> \u2014 <a href=\"/s/article/Setting-up-Recurring-Billing\" target=\"_parent\" data-lightning-target=\"_subtab\">Recurring or subscription payments<\/a> are supported.<\/li><li><strong>MSF Payments<\/strong> \u2014 Supports <a href=\"/s/article/Multi-Storefront-Payment-Methods\" target=\"_parent\" data-lightning-target=\"_subtab\">multiple payment configurations<\/a>.<\/li><\/ul>\n<table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><strong>Payment Gateway<\/strong><\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Manual Capture<\/strong><\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>3D Secure<\/strong><\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Multicurrency<\/strong><\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Stored Payment Methods<\/strong><\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Recurring Payments<\/strong><\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>MSF Payments<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/s/article/Connecting-with-Access-Worldpay\" target=\"_parent\" data-lightning-target=\"_subtab\">Access Worldpay<\/a><\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td><\/tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/s/article/Connecting-with-Adyen\" target=\"_parent\" data-lightning-target=\"_subtab\">Adyen<\/a><\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td><\/tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/s/article/Connecting-with-Affirm\" target=\"_parent\" data-lightning-target=\